      "answer": "a_n = 3^n - 2^n",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "a_n = 3^n - 2^n"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "递推式两边同除以 3^{n+1}，得 a_{n+1}/3^{n+1} = (2/3)·(a_n/3^n) + 1/3。令 b_n = a_n/3^n，则 b_{n+1} = (2/3)b_n + 1/3，构造等比数列解得 b_n = 1 - (2/3)^n，故 a_n = 3^n - 2^n。"
